{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340160/extras/dcd345c41794637a7158598c9d417702.poster.avif?t=1773864211\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340160/extras/dcd345c41794637a7158598c9d417702.webm?t=1773864211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340160/extras/dcd345c41794637a7158598c9d417702.mp4?t=1773864211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lenrual is a short and weird environmental puzzle game with unique mechanics. Jump into an evening in town and find out how things play out. Will you\u2014</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint the town gold?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commune with or become a god?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or just go back to sleep once the night settles?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, communicate or figure out things and carve out a place for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>If you like obtuse, cryptic and strange games, dive into Lenrual for an interesting experience.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Important Note: Does not feature a save system upon closing the game.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lenrual now features a discreet save system!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Playtime is usually 1-2 hours but once you've figured everything out, you can go from start to finish within 12 minutes 48 seconds(developer's personal speedrun record).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small, dense open world to freely explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique conversation mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtuse interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ludonarratives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanically diverse branches</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Lenrual is an obtuse game with little to no hand holding. If you're lost on what to do, just try out different things and listen to your dreams.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340160/extras/7a4ffe601c377800404a3660d1353072.poster.avif?t=1773864211\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340160/extras/7a4ffe601c377800404a3660d1353072.webm?t=1773864211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340160/extras/7a4ffe601c377800404a3660d1353072.mp4?t=1773864211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"painting_bondage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3340160/70d9aec931955e07bbe17460e7f7c52c9222ac04.jpg"},{"name":"painting_float","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3340160/24110d457343a7ff8396bd6f534d033d87a111a7.jpg"},{"name":"painting_need","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3340160/caf01971cccf24ccdbf78f679c75f7e2df7c628a.jpg"},{"name":"Thangchhuah","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3340160/616d8299442dfa82952bef55f322877f47c16288.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3340160?t=1773864211","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340160/76e4362232afba8734284b2a772931b77a011f5a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773864211","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340160/f903aef416d1df6ef79f62647eb1196cb8408298/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773864211","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340160/f903aef416d1df6ef79f62647eb1196cb8408298/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773864211","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4492830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340160/extras/dcd345c41794637a7158598c9d417702.poster.avif?t=1773864211\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340160/extras/dcd345c41794637a7158598c9d417702.webm?t=1773864211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340160/extras/dcd345c41794637a7158598c9d417702.mp4?t=1773864211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lenrual is a short and weird environmental puzzle game with unique mechanics. Jump into an evening in town and find out how things play out. Will you\u2014</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint the town gold?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commune with or become a god?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or just go back to sleep once the night settles?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, communicate or figure out things and carve out a place for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>If you like obtuse, cryptic and strange games, dive into Lenrual for an interesting experience.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Important Note: Does not feature a save system upon closing the game.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lenrual now features a discreet save system!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Playtime is usually 1-2 hours but once you've figured everything out, you can go from start to finish within 12 minutes 48 seconds(developer's personal speedrun record).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small, dense open world to freely explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique conversation mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtuse interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ludonarratives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanically diverse branches</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Lenrual is an obtuse game with little to no hand holding. If you're lost on what to do, just try out different things and listen to your dreams.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340160/extras/7a4ffe601c377800404a3660d1353072.poster.avif?t=1773864211\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340160/extras/7a4ffe601c377800404a3660d13530